Tell the config-server that files changed in swimlane sit1?
Files (supplied by the assistant), 2 files: "tx-core/a\" (supplied by Lanekeeper) Approved by an admin-si…", "tx-core/b-sit1.yml"
Effect: the swimlane's agent calls the config-server's /update-resources endpoint with these paths. That endpoint has no authentication; the call is audited. Services that listen for notifications reload the files at once. No file changes.
Review it in the web UI: https://hub.example.test/swimlanes/sit1
